sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007), Cartwright et al. (2009) & BCF (1951) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target loops, chitin pore mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet transition, 3D cholesteric chitin precursor coupling and brick-and-mortar tablet-sliding fracture — Model fidelity to source: 89/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "The Pass 2 solvers are unchanged and still match Cartwright & Checa (2007) / BCF (1951) as formulated: Gibbs-Thomson step velocity, multi-dislocation eikonal step flow, Frank-Read dipole clearance, mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet stacking and Voronoi coalescence. Pass 3 adds a correct de Gennes cholesteric construction (n = (cos phi, sin phi, 0), phi = (pi/h_0)(z - u), half-pitch = h_0, n = -n so S = cos 2 phi) in which the BCF phase enters as the layer displacement u, so membranes are helicoids and the Burgers vector equals the net screw charge (+5 vs a template-free v2), and a tension-shear-chain / Schmid-slip / waviness-hardening / Griffith-cap fracture model that reproduces the Jackson, Wang and Gao orders of magnitude (+4). Deductions: the cholesteric coupling is kinematic — no Frank free-energy, no pitch selection, no director dynamics — so it is a template imposed by the BCF phase rather than the self-assembly Cartwright et al. (2009) describe, and the function's own docstring says so (-5); the terrace pitch returned to the ledger is 0.15 raw + 0.85 analytic, so the solver's pitch is never actually tested against theory (-3); the Law 3 stacking margin is a hard-coded literal (42 - 80*2, 78 - 36*1) rather than computed from the simulated fields (-3); tablets are elastic-brittle with no intra-tablet crystal plasticity and sigma_f = Phi sigma_crit / 2 hits 170 MPa by the flaw = h/2 convention (-3); `pitch_tower`, `tower_spacing`, `spacing` constants are unsourced (-1)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L435–L451: _measure_radial_terrace_pitch returns 0.15 * raw_pitch + 0.85 * theo_pitch — the reported 'measured' pitch is 85 % the analytic value <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L435-L451>",
            "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L521–L529: Docstring states the coupling is a kinematic liquid-crystal template, NOT a Frank free-energy minimisation; q / period / Burgers are consistency checks of the construction <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L521-L529>",
            "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L719–L735: stacking_margin = 42 - 80 * 2 and 78 - 36 * 1 are literals, not computed from the simulated mineral-bridge / terrace fields <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L719-L735>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-3> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.89"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L480–L611" ;
        dcterms:description "reconstruct_continuous_bcf_phase (exact Phi_2D from floor/angle) and simulate_cholesteric_chitin_lamellar_3d: helicoidal director, S = cos 2 phi, aragonite occupancy, finite-difference twist rate, z-spectrum period, loop-integral Burgers vector" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L480-L611> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L995–L1110" ;
        dcterms:description "simulate_tablet_sliding_fracture: TSC elastic branch, Schmid yield sigma_y = Phi rho tau_p / 2, waviness hardening H = E_n tan^2 psi / t_m, Griffith cap, three failure-mode branches (L1037-L1046), Gamma collapse to Gamma_m on brittle fracture (L1073-L1077)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L995-L1110> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_078_nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals.lean L118–L201" ;
        dcterms:description "Theorems cholesteric_half_pitch_screw_dislocation_coupling (P = 2 h_0, (+1,-1) zero Burgers, (+1,+1) b = P, 2 pi v_z strictly increasing in h_0) and tsc_tablet_sliding_fracture_toughness (sigma_y < sigma_f ductile at 20 MPa, yield-before-fracture iff tau_p <= 22, Gamma monotone and inside Jackson range); 5 theorems, 0 sorry, lean exit 0" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_078_nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals.lean#L118-L201> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (Pass 3 remediation-round primary assessor, slot-078 Phase B)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "claude-fable-5-1" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://www.anthropic.com> .
}

